POST {{host}}/api/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

 { "userName": "asha", "expiresInMinutes": 1 }

### 31 Create order WITHOUT a token -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Asha Rao",
  "items": [ { "sku": "kb-001", "quantity": 1 } ]
}


